<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to sell 25,000 tonnes July/Aug NGL.</title>
<headline>India tenders to sell 25,000 tonnes July/Aug NGL.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has tendered to sell 25,000 tonnes of natural gas liquids for lifting from Hazira on the Indian west coast between July 31-August 2, industry sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender will close July 24 and is valid for one day.</p>
<p>IOC's tender to sell July 24-26 ex-Hazira NGL closed on Wednesday is valid until later today.</p>
<p>In its last tender, IOC sold a cargo lifting 12-14 to a Dutch trader at $37.00 per tonne below Japanese spot quotes on a free-on-board basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
